abstract: >-
  First-principles electroweak identity map from the E47 kernel
  K=(C-6I)(C-30I) on H=V2^3 (dim 125). Omega_c=47/125.
  Sole dimensionful input G_F. Headline identities:
  m_Z^(0)=v Omega_c, m_W/m_Z=sqrt(10/13), m_t/m_H=1+Omega_c=172/125.
  The integer-246 mass ladder is audit-only. No look-elsewhere p-value is claimed.
